    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN US!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to join our  official Discord to share your ideas with us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X:\u00a0@qiyudixiacheng</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are &quot;Bread On Board,&quot; a collective of independent game developers spread across four countries, united by our passion and meeting during a GameJam. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game demo was born in the &quot;BOOOM CHALLENGE&quot;, a GameJam by GCORES. With only 21 days, we created a game based on a given theme. After the competition, we even won the &quot;Most Popular Game&quot; award at an Online Game Trial Event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full playthrough of our game will take about an hour. We hope to give you a short, but super heartwarming and loving adventure\u2764\ufe0f.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/f2fb98f22516cc2ef75dfabcc6d76de0.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=167 /></span>A rookie adventurer fresh on the scene and a former mercenary who was transferred into an adventurer due to injury. Two protagonists with contrasting personalities will embark on an adventure of fantasy and healing together. In the mysterious ruins of an underground dungeon that lies in the depth of a jungle, what awaits them will be...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/0ce9f47e68ca900a7a74583a216e73fc.poster.avif?t=1727596063\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/0ce9f47e68ca900a7a74583a216e73fc.webm?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/0ce9f47e68ca900a7a74583a216e73fc.mp4?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/231373c379eae1c19d276ee03b0bd52a.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=167 /></span>According to the tavern's adventurer logs, the team heading into the dungeon features a rookie adventurer and an ex-mercenary who is now working as a healer. The adventurer looks as charming as a doll, and the enthusiasm never disappears; the healer is cool and a bit traditional, acting as a guiding figure for their adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/debbdf6ccf5fd922ea314ed2a0ad0ba0.poster.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/debbdf6ccf5fd922ea314ed2a0ad0ba0.webm?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/debbdf6ccf5fd922ea314ed2a0ad0ba0.mp4?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What stories have unfolded between these two contrasting characters, and what challenges will they face together in this adventure? The continuation of this adventurous story is yours to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/5d643a5e039e52f600e6e6a5877fd1ca.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=167 /></span>&quot;People think battles need powerful weapons, but strategy at hand is key.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/722645ce8e7ea54bf2600cc8ffcf2788.poster.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/722645ce8e7ea54bf2600cc8ffcf2788.webm?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/722645ce8e7ea54bf2600cc8ffcf2788.mp4?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Cureocity,&quot; the power of your strategy is materialized as the numerical values of your hands in combat. You can swap different weapons or items held in your left and right hands to alter your character's attack and defense stats. You may also change &quot;gestures&quot; to focus attacks or land heavy blows on specific enemies.As you delve deeper into the dungeon, you will take the unique traits of monsters into consideration and discuss strategies with your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/8ec0b42daa4622acc04a057cc258f02b.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=167 /></span>In this adventure, you'll discover not only the secrets hidden within the dungeon, but also the truths about the world and the  characters themselves. When faced with contaminated monsters, you can choose to either fight them or attempt to purify them. Of course, you also have the option to let things take their own course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/e18a1b58dfd603adda485e77a64c42ac.poster.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/e18a1b58dfd603adda485e77a64c42ac.webm?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/e18a1b58dfd603adda485e77a64c42ac.mp4?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each decision,the fate of the protagonists may change. The end of this adventure... is yours to decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Publisher</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GCORES PUBLISHING is an independent game publishing venture formed by GCORES, committed to bringing you more outstanding indie games from the BOOOM CHALLENGE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to follow our publisher webpage for future updates.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are &quot;Bread On Board,&quot; a collective of independent game developers spread across four countries, united by our passion and meeting during a GameJam. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game demo was born in the &quot;BOOOM CHALLENGE&quot;, a GameJam by GCORES. With only 21 days, we created a game based on a given theme. After the competition, we even won the &quot;Most Popular Game&quot; award at an Online Game Trial Event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full playthrough of our game will take about an hour. We hope to give you a short, but super heartwarming and loving adventure\u2764\ufe0f.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/f2fb98f22516cc2ef75dfabcc6d76de0.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=167 /></span>A rookie adventurer fresh on the scene and a former mercenary who was transferred into an adventurer due to injury. Two protagonists with contrasting personalities will embark on an adventure of fantasy and healing together. In the mysterious ruins of an underground dungeon that lies in the depth of a jungle, what awaits them will be...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/0ce9f47e68ca900a7a74583a216e73fc.poster.avif?t=1727596063\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/0ce9f47e68ca900a7a74583a216e73fc.webm?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/0ce9f47e68ca900a7a74583a216e73fc.mp4?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/231373c379eae1c19d276ee03b0bd52a.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=167 /></span>According to the tavern's adventurer logs, the team heading into the dungeon features a rookie adventurer and an ex-mercenary who is now working as a healer. The adventurer looks as charming as a doll, and the enthusiasm never disappears; the healer is cool and a bit traditional, acting as a guiding figure for their adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/debbdf6ccf5fd922ea314ed2a0ad0ba0.poster.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/debbdf6ccf5fd922ea314ed2a0ad0ba0.webm?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/debbdf6ccf5fd922ea314ed2a0ad0ba0.mp4?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What stories have unfolded between these two contrasting characters, and what challenges will they face together in this adventure? The continuation of this adventurous story is yours to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/5d643a5e039e52f600e6e6a5877fd1ca.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=167 /></span>&quot;People think battles need powerful weapons, but strategy at hand is key.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/722645ce8e7ea54bf2600cc8ffcf2788.poster.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/722645ce8e7ea54bf2600cc8ffcf2788.webm?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/722645ce8e7ea54bf2600cc8ffcf2788.mp4?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Cureocity,&quot; the power of your strategy is materialized as the numerical values of your hands in combat. You can swap different weapons or items held in your left and right hands to alter your character's attack and defense stats. You may also change &quot;gestures&quot; to focus attacks or land heavy blows on specific enemies.As you delve deeper into the dungeon, you will take the unique traits of monsters into consideration and discuss strategies with your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/8ec0b42daa4622acc04a057cc258f02b.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=167 /></span>In this adventure, you'll discover not only the secrets hidden within the dungeon, but also the truths about the world and the  characters themselves. When faced with contaminated monsters, you can choose to either fight them or attempt to purify them. Of course, you also have the option to let things take their own course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/e18a1b58dfd603adda485e77a64c42ac.poster.avif?t=1727596063\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/e18a1b58dfd603adda485e77a64c42ac.webm?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612680/extras/e18a1b58dfd603adda485e77a64c42ac.mp4?t=1727596063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each decision,the fate of the protagonists may change. The end of this adventure... is yours to decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Publisher</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GCORES PUBLISHING is an independent game publishing venture formed by GCORES, committed to bringing you more outstanding indie games from the BOOOM CHALLENGE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to follow our publisher webpage for future updates.</p>",
